OL,3,GNEWSASports leaders raise leisure
OL,4,Acentre fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA leisure centre's future is causing
OL,7,Fconcern among sports clubs, with
OL,8,Fnetball and squash representatives
OL,9,Fwarning that any loss of facilities
OL,10,Fcould have a major impact.
OL,12,FGuernsey's Beau Sejour leisure centre
OL,13,Fis in a "persistent operating deficit"
OL,14,Fand a "solution has not been defined",
OL,15,Fa sustainability report said.
OL,17,FNaomi Szmierek, of the Guernsey Netball
OL,18,FAssociation, said netball was already
OL,19,Fstruggling with a lack of court space
OL,20,Fand said the sport was not meeting
OL,21,Fdemand across junior, community and
OL,22,Fisland programmes.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
