OL,3,GNEWSASports leaders raise leisure
OL,4,Acentre fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FMartin Watts, treasurer of Guernsey
OL,7,FSquash and Racquetball Association,
OL,8,Fsaid Beau Sejour was "crucial" because
OL,9,Fit was now the only venue on the island
OL,10,Fwhere squash could be played.
